{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_14bdfab44509b1b44797209d949e2219ac69d15dfa2219608fb568681b4235c9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_41dd2b9c106b7936cb892c8e738abe7bfc45b193eb9f7ce6de897cf50f792bb4","slc_b21cc940849d7dd686ddbabf0325b2363a6df873f9feee21da4581fd19c0b9fe","slc_ca1d24624c7811f4e8e9875dd624b069b7255ca5795f5c8c9de30692c839dee3"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6","src_4e3dce47cb5256e68ee1492dbd788c6a","src_6db95606c41d5a9ba641a3d0bd4d9ed0"],"text":"Devika supports multiple LLM providers including Claude, GPT-4/GPT-3, Gemini, Mistral, Groq, and self-hosted models via Ollama, with a unified LLM class abstracting provider APIs; the README recommends the Claude 3 family for optimal performance.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1d7a27b8b04ec56728b0ac5bdb318ef6fa6ba9df9294894b80e6d8f7977c6f1d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4692c30b40d56e2372520d084dd966794a4a7a613e81b73304cb31214aeb0d86","slc_7caedf4c5ad833870937d2f79f8a281f843964f7623c7ae00b28d10540f30dc1","slc_e229495257c57480384be21dd7ad10009706d6a4a4ad0a538a50823bc2a6ae44","slc_e50e94cf150b7418ebda846a3ff9f0a04a02e50e1bea0222508dc989e6e3d576"],"source_ids":["src_4e3dce47cb5256e68ee1492dbd788c6a"],"text":"Runtime requirements are Python >= 3.10 and < 3.12, Node.js >= 18, and bun; Playwright is installed for browser capabilities, and API keys (OpenAI, Claude, Bing, Google, Netlify, etc.) are configured via a config.toml file and the UI settings page.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_281ba8de7fae4deccd59510211fefbd5ec291a194aa052e328aba38ef476de70","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_37ae3427aa55ae8ca9f696ff63ff4cb180ad0dff900d481446cd0fe2f5a4a4c2","slc_ab9793df7d787ff37f0ebac919a879c7ac77e5c415509245ea03448628429754"],"source_ids":["src_4e3dce47cb5256e68ee1492dbd788c6a"],"text":"Devika is positioned as an open-source alternative to Cognition AI's Devin, with the stated goal of matching and eventually beating Devin's SWE-bench score; the README also points to Opcode as its successor iteration.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2ef8170cd13868481f5a1cc711be6664a05135f2cbd9dcb5048a2370e1121e50","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ed055709a9133955faac80e933799f3aee7089c762f72d31f424f96520a53f6e"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Agents are designed to be stateless and idempotent where possible, with state and history managed centrally by the Agent Core and passed into agents as needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3c9ab9f86d4953be3311393b64c74883d9e292d0b0a6f77c785a66283b291de8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_358c804f5fb47a5d8be78cd195334d0f98456bc8bf2b800dfd20a5fe672dd17b","slc_80d5c2cb8eed4d6e314fda74d79cd96547579171fdf4d61b8d303e203fe1a167"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6","src_6db95606c41d5a9ba641a3d0bd4d9ed0"],"text":"The Agent Core runs a loop where a user prompt goes to the Planner for a step plan, the Researcher extracts search queries, web results are formatted, and the Coder generates code saved to disk; follow-up prompts route through an Action agent to Runner, Feature, Patcher, or Reporter agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_49b8fe536eac252e34cf122a6ad079b9c1d8818b99b8afd95bd176e16f50c2da","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_95878ed365ff2d1c75cd8ec71c57de601907a8fa97df65f272a1b3f861a44144","slc_9a5ac58bb9df5dd9797e0e647d1d7bad00430c47ca8560027f7fdc99d608cd7b","slc_d9dced18d46db35a3f26fc33e7600a3b4958828c511599bbe9ba46666e923d2a"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Devika integrates external services through GitHub and Netlify wrapper classes for git operations (clone, listing repos) and deploying web apps, returning deployed site URLs to the user.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_622d45aa66c0f7e051e9bfcd0bd046cde791790c992cd8d7dd934e255462c8eb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_bb25c1b26ce3c58c78222aed9e9ccba31c7eab97ccb12e50388a92cd88c07d61","slc_e1690b09ae61bf61d290393f250d1c8250966cc66fc423b05e88eb68c8a87065"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Each sub-agent is implemented as a separate Python class and communicates with LLMs via Jinja2 prompt templates, following a render-query-validate-return pattern.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_89017ea5798b949442207ac1ef8d483e87e6eb39ea8761c48b4340ddc3709084","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_55f3572e317f388b2797178efa19c3354e1c42fe1aac1be815d49374395120f5","slc_a3c93c2a79f46369422ef9476a0ef761e2681e3c886db6939d2e2e43ca7d818a","slc_c5b87b3f0f3b197fe8ce165aedf7b46f2bec1202d3c87d8dda3374946c0cf671"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Browser automation is provided by Browser and Crawler classes built on Playwright (Chromium), supporting navigation, DOM queries, content extraction, screenshots, and an LLM-driven action loop (e.g. CLICK or TYPE commands) over live pages.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_90899b63be99daf23563bbde8a4a20e8f08584d2892cbdbe472bb33f86c51198","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d7a0c1ac0489721e769330c6b9da0582f47e54c9c787fd415060c5645c86d06","slc_4a59007250ece5bd111f050e3f1ef0e43de78f84a435db783742cbd24a25ff77","slc_cacdc3024897a6a73b25f4b261b2dae74943a6525d3b608cfb109f0b61a8517c","slc_fc3d858796b42cb4d48bfc17782573c93f900e2934b76e8ae9ad184d26237e41"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Project metadata and agent state (steps, internal monologue, browser/terminal interactions, token usage) are persisted in SQLite via SQLModel, enabling multi-project work, session continuity, auditing, and resume after interruptions.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a4fae0888b325dc2e1ba1e5a692f4777f4377a53e981e12205ce66a880022664","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3584c9a02023b6e1c6133f93a89be02cdca65194f064417a438924e405ac4277"],"source_ids":["src_4e3dce47cb5256e68ee1492dbd788c6a"],"text":"The README states the project is in a very early development/experimental stage with many unimplemented or broken features at the time of writing.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c01d4593d3c981c9ef79be09549b11dc4cf1fc31cc8b3357d63fb78d62e153af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_66c49ed13b160133fcf5e3515f0a26ad78c1da8efd053c9c678293ff7246ec87","slc_d27c527830b325edac29bded6734ce102479f3904d3ac691937996efeb3f3779"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6","src_ab94924805e15fb0bcc0479857a9a070"],"text":"Devika's documented architecture includes a web chat UI, an Agent Core orchestrating planning and execution, specialized sub-agents, LLM integration, browser interaction, project/state management, and a database layer.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ddd283470e3650deea1e05350d740f41f84009a25061643cfc909d39a2f3b6e9","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"stitionai/devika@80bb343cbe4a snapshot 201e280ced5e9941","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_11786ab8e1e9b415c840f0f96d8130c5c639cd01348e3e81e499ffd7bb75e172"],"source_ids":["src_182c87c260b85aec966fa770f29052f6"],"text":"Stated design principles include modularity via specialized agents, pluggable LLMs and services, persistence for pause/resume and auditing, and real-time transparency of the agent's thought process to the user.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_76ece0e063fb4365bc055e961d3f1825"}
